/*
 * The Trend — v1 receipts page ported (design-spec-v2 §6). Owner: w5-receipts-chrome.
 * Body markup is CONTENT-IDENTICAL to site/trend.html between the shared chrome:
 * same prose, STAT comments, references, tables, and inline enhancement script.
