<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>The Trend &middot; US Wildfires</title>
<meta name="description" content="The thesis defended: the highs are higher and so are the lows. Original analysis of NIFC annual burned area, 1983-2025, with EPA/NCA5 context.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<style is:inline>
